# UI

Functional React components in `src/ui/`. Entry is `src/renderer.tsx`.

Talk to main only through `window.netxscan`. No `ipcRenderer` in components.

Use official shadcn/ui from `npx shadcn@latest add` (`components.json`, `src/components/ui`). Import via `@/components/ui/...`. Lucide for categories and WinRM. Clinic teal via CSS variables. Do not add a CSS-in-JS library.

Prefer small panels over one giant `App.tsx`. Keep `App.tsx` as shell (loading + current view). Light theme only unless the user asks otherwise.
